B.CU=new A.aF("First are the five rotors, at the starting position A-B-C-D-E.\nThey have 26 letters each, which gives over 11881376 starting positions.\nAt the buttom, the plugbard adds almost 26*25*24... (26!) combinations by pairing letters, making the number of encryptions astronomical.\nOn your journey you will find encrypted messages, that needs to be decrypted using The Enigma.\n\nGood Luck - Ciphero",null,B.u,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
