B.CV=new A.aF("Welcome to my App.\nHere, knowledge means nothing \u2014 only logic, intelligence, and relentless persistence will guide you.\nCan you uncover all the trophies... and unlock the secret that lies hidden within?\nEvery puzzle is a key. Every step brings you closer \u2014 or deeper into the unknown.\n\nGood luck.\n- Ciphero",null,B.u,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
